###Combine

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}2\blueE{m}+3\maroonD{n}+\goldE{5}+\goldE{6}
\\\\
&=2\blueE{m}+3\maroonD{n}+\goldE{11}
\end{align}$

We cannot combine $2\blueE{m}+3\maroonD{n}$ since they aren't like terms.
